[invicti_vulnerabilities://<name>]
account = Select an account configured under Configuration → Account.
asset_id = If set, only vulnerabilities of the given asset are collected.
index = (Default: default)
interval = Time interval (in seconds) between two collection runs. Minimum 60. (Default: 300)
origin_id = If set, only vulnerabilities of the given origin are collected.
page_size = Vulnerabilities per API page (1-200). Default 50. (Default: 50)
